{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1000_p", "source_sha256": "84b729a3e47fc0f19060ca60e3e33860de982179bd260ce67a90f8b013a16f55", "ja": "（未来と昴が出演するドラマの撮影だ。ふたりが扮する\n神様が、活気を失った村を救うという話なのだが……）", "zh": "（这是未来和昴出演的电视剧拍摄。两人饰演的神明要拯救一个失去活力的村子，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "27a881f4c146f5bdfce1a2ccdc2c23f6f090989c7c9857236e47977e754357b9", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ！\n今日の撮影、人がいっぱいだなー！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n今天拍摄现场人好多啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c5bda5f14d7f069083f1b79470afca87dc1ef55548cccea0c63ce30a81a3baca", "ja": "ああ。村人役のエキストラの皆さんだよ。\n役場の人達が声をかけて、集めてくれたんだ。", "zh": "啊，是来演村民的临时演员们。\n是镇公所的人联系他们，把大家召集过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "7e1e58a892d5538857fa3863e3274a5c459d6ba5dbdf525c15d81cdef9ea171a", "ja": "そうなんですね！　みんな、すっごく気合いが入ってて\n私も頑張らなきゃって気持ちになりました！", "zh": "原来是这样啊！大家都干劲十足的，让我也觉得自己必须加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "73f7f5527efa1cbd822cd19286cbf1f7c041b9b38eff3a41dcc94669b5f51b66", "ja": "オレも！　おじさんから「頑張れよ」って言われてさ。\n……へへっ、期待に応えなきゃだよな！", "zh": "我也是！叔叔还对我说“加油啊”。\n……嘿嘿，不能辜负他的期待啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ae914116fa6d367fd6a0ee701e131029803b84719e0c5d4ac03c438f11e31a04", "ja": "はは、そうだな。最近、この辺りは\n観光客が減って、活気がなくなってるそうでね。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。听说最近这附近游客变少了，也没以前那么有活力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "cc2042d6ecffc72ba9644fbe5b744030eee321a1fd79dc80adbe824277891a83", "ja": "そうなんですか？　ご飯も美味しくて、\n景色もキレイで、すっごくいい場所なのに……。", "zh": "是这样吗？这里的饭菜很好吃，景色也很漂亮，明明是个特别棒的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "4836b81b34ec822ba0ac70338fb7d9187eaa799eaaba36229b8f9910ecb3f266", "ja": "あ！　だから私たち、期待されてるのかな～？\nこのドラマが人気になったら、ここも盛り上がるよね！", "zh": "啊！所以大家才会对我们寄予厚望吧～？\n要是这部电视剧火了，这里也会热闹起来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "ac720c4a72db98cc1f4b2b78fcc34266f5a0c39148254c0e48d9eabbeaa3a3ce", "ja": "未来、頭いい～♪　えっと、確か……『聖地巡礼』って\nいうんだっけ？　百合子や亜利沙がしてるよな！", "zh": "未来，脑子真好使～♪　嗯，我记得是叫……“圣地巡礼”来着？\n百合子和亚利沙也会去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9ba5141b7473d92520ee1fd1fdcb9aa5b46297c7bfa0733e62b64d8696b2b07a", "ja": "まあ、そういう期待はあると思うけど……\n純粋に、嬉しいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嘛，虽说应该也有那方面的期待……\n但单纯只是觉得高兴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cd263729fbe7f23c6f05bd1b3be6bba658ab59743bedeeacd2a84329dc1f8cf5", "ja": "撮影地に選んでもらったこととか、\nこの土地の魅力に、気づいてもらえたこととか。", "zh": "被选为拍摄地，还有让大家发现了这片土地的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "d99cc3098a47435222c42cc91315656b18a71b76154104d3e1b0ced84540b1b0", "ja": "ふーん、そっかー……あれ？\nそれって、なんかこのドラマと似てない？", "zh": "嗯——这样啊……咦？\n这不就和这部电视剧有点像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "385cb53b84864fe664c8df4f14dc29de34d45f520efb1019d71c150a02a1a932", "ja": "あ、本当だー！　村のみんなが困ってて、\n神様たちも、なんとかしたいって思ってるところー！", "zh": "啊，真的耶——！村里的人都遇到了麻烦，\n神明们也正想着要想办法帮忙——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "98ae0830098aca9c83ca0cab293c8a569220e81ddf76cf69e028481785303e7b", "ja": "じゃあ、私たちがこの場所を……。\nそうだ！　ねえねえ昴、ちょっと耳貸して？", "zh": "那我们就来把这里……  \n对了！喂喂，昴，过来听我说悄悄话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c9aea061cf06c7671690048d3dc8e0f086acf9358bc5d7760e6380f20dc92077", "ja": "ん？　二人共、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？你们两个怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "a34d0e59e4fbb29368406cd10079ff101016fa44536e8debc98decb1664e0e53", "ja": "……なるほど、面白そうじゃん♪\nそれじゃ早速、やってみようぜ！", "zh": "……原来如此，听起来挺有意思的嘛♪\n那就事不宜迟，赶紧试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1016_p", "source_sha256": "453c16679ffa48db6d43159ebdd7f2c7639ae2f244c1ba69f4f15f84dee5c44e", "ja": "お、おい！　どこに行くんだー！？", "zh": "喂、喂！你要去哪儿啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1017_ekisutoranominasan", "source_sha256": "82ebf799d56deec962de19efa6026172b2ca5d67074f6b53ffcbde3212de816a", "ja": "ザワザワ……ガヤガヤ……。", "zh": "窸窸窣窣……嘈嘈杂杂……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "60a76a416340b156c44f6c7b9e08a182ec59d7f1931bfc9f031e54b7f6e99946", "ja": "みんなー！　今日は集まってくれて、ありがとなー！\nこのあとの撮影、楽しもうぜ！", "zh": "大家——！谢谢你们今天来集合——！\n接下来的拍摄，一起开心地完成吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "06dba21a1c1088ba3235774f325945546af312800c25081221a22e56c31a81d9", "ja": "ドラマを見た人が、ここを好きになってくれるように、\n私たちも一生懸命やります！　だから……。", "zh": "希望看了这部剧的人都能喜欢上这里，\n我们也会努力加油的！所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0574_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "ee7304e79f9bc4e238650dd612c92e047af463bbef936060c83729ef16a7c0ff", "ja": "みんなで頑張りましょう！", "zh": "大家一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
